        "content": "## Contact Form Router\n\n**Webhook**: POST /webhook/contact-form (requires `X-Webhook-Secret` header — sent by the www-215-tech Cloudflare Worker)\n\nPipeline:\n1. **Validate** — drop submissions without a parseable email\n2. **Spam filter** — Claude Haiku via OpenRouter classifies; spam gets a :wastebasket: Slack note only (fails open if classifier is down)\n3. **Zendesk Org Match** — email domain matched against org `domain_names` (client-side; Zendesk search can't query domains) → ticket linked to org\n4. **Zendesk User Match** — known user → ticket\n5. **Existing Attio Contact** — upsert person, add note, notify #sales\n6. **New Lead** — find/create company (business domains only), create person *linked to company*, add both to lead lists, note, notify #sales\n\nErrors go to the **Workflow Error Handler** (Slack DM to Robby).",
